Subject: [PATCH 060/913] plat-stm32mp2: default enable
 CFG_DRIVERS_CLOCK_PRINT_TREE

Default enable CFG_DRIVERS_CLOCK_PRINT_TREE for stm32mp2 platform.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git da30cbe86b0dc20605ee773a0ca9ccb6328b7601 plat-stm32mp2: default enable CFG_DRIVERS_CLOCK_PRINT_TREE]
Change-Id: Ic94975313cf9bf2e495051bb70d9c0a65fe2c0e3
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
index 7bf0657e6..012331c91 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
+++ b/core/arch/arm/plat-stm32mp2/conf.mk
@@ -146,6 +146,8 @@ CFG_SCMI_SERVER_CLOCK_CONSUMER ?= y
 CFG_SCMI_SERVER_REGULATOR_CONSUMER ?= y
 CFG_SCMI_SERVER_RESET_CONSUMER ?= y
 # Default enable some test facitilites
+CFG_DRIVERS_CLK_PRINT_TREE ?= y
+CFG_DRIVERS_REGULATOR_PRINT_TREE ?= y
 CFG_ENABLE_EMBEDDED_TESTS ?= y
 CFG_WITH_STATS ?= y
 CFG_WERROR ?= y
